                                                "sense_id": "9c2f2203-5255-3e83-9c5e-5878038373f7",
                                                "text": "the Microscope can afford us hundreds of Instances of Points many thousand times sharper: such as […] the ends of the stiriæ or small parallelipipeds of Amianthus […]"
